MerkleAdapter signatures
├── setSignature
│   ├── rejects direct callers including owner and leaf role holders
│   ├── requires current Merkle proof and leaf role
│   ├── pins the validator and policy in the setter leaf
│   ├── stores and emits the exact envelope
│   └── replaces or clears a digest independently
└── isValidSignature
    ├── rejects unapproved digests and empty or changed envelopes
    ├── passes the original digest and adapter context to the validator
    ├── supports several validators without installing capabilities
    ├── takes precedence over installed capability selectors
    ├── rejects writing, reverting, short-returning, EOA and self validators
    ├── rejects malformed return padding
    ├── malformed approved envelopes may revert but remain revocable
    └── root and role changes preserve approvals until explicitly revoked
